; `scoreboard players reset <targets>` without an objective removes every score of the targets
; (Guns++ `scoreboard players reset @e[scores={size_time=1000}]`). Compiled code left the scores in place.
@setup
objective create t dummy
objective create u dummy

@function run
scoreboard players set #r1 t 1
scoreboard players set #r1 u 2
scoreboard players set #r2 t 3
scoreboard players set #keep t 4
scoreboard players reset #r1
summon marker ~ ~ ~ {Tags:["mcfc_reset"]}
scoreboard players set @e[type=marker,tag=mcfc_reset] u 1000
scoreboard players set @e[type=marker,tag=mcfc_reset] t 5
scoreboard players reset @e[type=marker,scores={u=1000}]
execute store result score marker t run execute if score @e[type=marker,tag=mcfc_reset,limit=1] t matches 5
execute store success score r2 u run scoreboard players reset #r2
kill @e[type=marker,tag=mcfc_reset]

@validate
score #keep t is 4
score marker t is 0
score r2 u is 1
